        <h2 class="comic-h2">THREE FAILURES COST YOUR FIRM MORE THAN MARKETING EVER&nbsp;COULD.</h2>
        <p class="comic-body" style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          A custom combination matched to your firm's specific bottlenecks, not an off-the-shelf staffing package.
        </p>
        <div class="stat-cards">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-card-number">20%</div>
            <h3 class="stat-card-title">Intake Failure</h3>
            <p class="stat-card-body">Of leads vanish before anyone picks up the phone. Slow callbacks, broken handoffs. No-one's watching the door every day.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-card-number">15<span class="stat-plus">+</span> HRS</div>
